# Long Midgard /faction threads (Classic + Shrouded Isles, up to 1.65). New writing; names from
# docs/bot-voices/VERIFIED-NAMES.md, specialization lines from RESEARCH-BRIEF section 5.
# "A | B" on a beat = alternatives (one is picked), "?" = beat that only sometimes plays, "~ N" = lull.

@kind debate
@realm mid

@topic healer_shaman_second
@levels 25-50
@scene mid_heal_trio
@role B class=Healer
@role C class=Shaman
@role D type=Leveler,NoLifer
@role E type=Socialite
A: {q} putting together a spindel group tonight, healer plus shaman or two healers? | building an 8man for tonight, do i want a shaman or a second healer | real question for the realm: second healer or a shaman in a full group
B: two healers. one pacs, one mends, nobody dies | double healer every time, the group heals stack and you never run dry | second healer. more power in the pool means longer pulls
C: shaman. i cure the diseases and poisons and my debuffs make the pull die faster | you want a shaman, the debuffs alone save more health than a second heal would | a shaman turns a hard pull into an easy one, two healers just mop up
B: debuffs are nice until a mob resists them and the tank is still taking full hits
C: and two healers are nice until something diseases the tank and nobody can clear it | ok and who cures disease in your double healer group? nobody
D: i ran double healer through all of my 40s and never thought about disease once | honestly for xp double healer just chains faster, nobody sits for pow
~ 25
E: what did i walk into, the healer war again? | ah, heal debate. pull up a chair everyone | is this the shaman thing? i love the shaman thing
A: lol yes, round whatever it is now
?E: grabbing snacks, carry on
C: look, a shaman also buffs, so your healer can stop wasting power on buffs | with a shaman around the healer keeps power for heals instead of buffs
B: healer buffs are fine thanks | augmentation buffs do the job, i dont need help buffing
D: the real question is who is MA and whether the tank can hold aggro | none of it matters if the puller brings back three adds
?C: true, the puller is always the problem
~ 30
A: so if i only have one slot left? | ok but say i can only fit one of the two
B: healer, every time, the group lives or dies on the main heals
C: if the main healer is good, add a shaman. if not, two healers wont save you either | a good main healer plus a shaman beats two average healers
D: depends on the camp. spindel adds hit hard, more healing helps there | for spindelhalla id lean healer, for raumarik maybe shaman
E: or bring one of each and a skald and quit thinking so hard
?B: ...fair enough i guess
~ 20
A: ok shaman says yes in tells, healer slot still open if anyone wants it | update, i got a shaman, still lf one more healer for spindel | shaman signed up. need a healer, pst
B: sending you a tell now
C: told you it would end up with both of us | see, healer and shaman together, as midgard intended

@topic pac_or_mending
@levels 30-50
@scene mid_pac_mending
@role B class=Healer
